  "id": "macaroni-salad",
  "name": "Macaroni Salad",
  "subtitle": "Creamy chilled pasta salad with eggs and herbs",
  "description": "A cool American-style macaroni salad coated in a tangy mustard dressing with onion, parsley, celery seed, and chopped hard-cooked eggs.",
